LiquidationPeriphery::liquidate
├── when market is not a registered mint or borrow market
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInput
└── when market is registered
    ├── when market is a borrow market
    │   ├── it should return seized collateral, repaid borrow, and protocol fee from market
    │   ├── given repayViaUsm is false
    │   │   └── it should liquidate using borrow token from liquidator matching returned amounts
    │   └── given repayViaUsm is true
    │       ├── when stable token bought equals borrow amount to repay
    │       │   └── it should liquidate via usm without refunding stable to liquidator
    │       └── when stable token bought is greater than borrow amount to repay
    │           └── it should refund excess stable token to liquidator
    └── when market is a mint market
        ├── it should return seized collateral, repaid borrow, and protocol fee from market
        ├── given repayViaUsm is false
        │   └── it should liquidate using borrow token from liquidator matching returned amounts
        └── given repayViaUsm is true
            ├── when stable token bought equals borrow amount to repay
            │   └── it should liquidate via usm without refunding stable to liquidator
            └── when stable token bought is greater than borrow amount to repay
                └── it should refund excess stable token to liquidator
